      hu: "A Centralban lévő városháza volt a város első modern többcélú kulturális központja. 1962-ben nyílt meg, két fő blokkból áll.",
      ro: "Primăria din Central a fost primul centru cultural modern multifuncțional. Deschisă în 1962, cuprinde două blocuri principale.",
      en: "City Hall in Central was the city's first modern multi-purpose cultural center. Opened in 1962, it consists of two main blocks.",
